    "sentence_translations": [
      "",
      "Father Li Han noticed that his son Li Fei was a little unhappy in the past few days, and he wanted to know why.",
      "",
      "He asked his son, “What’s up? Why are you unhappy?”",
      "",
      "Li Fei did not say anything.",
      "",
      "“Is it because you don’t have money?”",
      "",
      "Li Fei said, “No.”",
      "",
      "Li Han’s family had a lot of money. He didn’t know why his son would be unhappy. What couldn’t money buy?",
      "",
      "Li Han said, “Will you tell dad what’s wrong? Is it that you want something?”",
      "",
      "Li Fei thought for a moment and said, “Yes.”",
      "",
      "Li Han smiled, “What do you want? I’ll buy it for you! Our family has a lot of money!”",
      "",
      "“Dad, money can’t buy everything. The thing that I want can’t be bought with money!” Li Fei said very unhappily.",
      "",
      "“Wrong! Money is able to buy everything! Speak, what do you want?”"
    ]
